            "<strong>Get help coming before you need it.</strong> Alert a colleague, know where the alarm is, and never go into a room alone with an escalating patient and a closed door.",
            "<strong>Position.</strong> Stand at an angle, not square-on, slightly more than an arm's length away, between the patient and nothing he wants; keep your own <strong>escape route</strong> to the door and do not block his; hands visible and open, below shoulder height; no sudden movements, no touching.",
