        "Violence is preceded by trigger and escalation — pacing, shouting, clenched fists, threats, invading space — and its strongest predictors are past violence, intoxication, command hallucinations and a crowded, idle ward; recovery after an assault takes up to 90 minutes and a second trigger restarts the cycle.",
